<title>FRANCE: Details of new monthly EU malt export refunds.</title>
<headline>Details of new monthly EU malt export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union raised the refunds applying to daily malt exports with effect from January 10, grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU took the decision at a weekly meeting of its grain panel on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new rates are as follows (in Ecus per tonne) -</p>
<p>			    January 10	  December 20</p>
<p> Wheat malt		  17.00		 8.00</p>
<p> Unroasted barley malt   37.70		15.00</p>
<p> Roasted barley malt     44.00		20.00</p>
</text>
